# RSVP Radio — 12 current Plex audio playlists / candidate programming pools.
# 2026-10-25 Pi read-only preflight: 12/12 available, every playlist complete.
# DRAFT ONLY. This file is NOT loaded by the app or systemd.
# Once the owner accepts these broad sources, copy the four values to the
# Pi's private .env; do not commit a real .env or restart production casually.
#
# These are source pools, NOT verified per-track vibe classifications.
# Era playlists include both high- and low-energy tracks, so this is not
# yet sufficient to guarantee DJ-level song-to-song compatibility.
#
# Mode LOFI   04:00-10:00 — Soul / Lounge
MUSIC_POOL_LOFI="70s Funk Soul|80s R&B|90s R&B|2000s R&B|2010s R&B|2020sR&B"
#
# Mode LOUNGE 10:00-17:00 — Throwback / R&B Dayparty
MUSIC_POOL_LOUNGE="70s Funk Soul|80s Hip Hip|80s R&B|90s Hip Hop|90s R&B|2000s Hip Hop|2000s R&B|2010s R&B|2020sR&B|Reggae"
#
# Mode RAP    17:00-23:00 — Party / Club / Game Night
MUSIC_POOL_RAP="80s Hip Hip|90s Hip Hop|2000s Hip Hop|2010s Hip Hop|2020s Hip Hip|2000s R&B|Reggae"
#
# Mode RNB    23:00-04:00 — Bedroom / Sensual / Slow Jams
MUSIC_POOL_RNB="80s R&B|90s R&B|2000s R&B|2010s R&B|2020sR&B"
